<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-102] Websocket doesn&apos;t update the query</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-102</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When we use two web browsers on the same note, any change is transfered to the other.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However when we rerun a paragraph after changing the text editor content, the other browser only gets the new result (not the new text editor content)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12837052">ZEPPELIN-102</key>
            <summary>Websocket doesn&apos;t update the query</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
